    "title": "Reliance Digital Global Group is Hiring: Floor Manager (Senior)",
    "description": "Grow your career with Reliance Digital Global Group! We are hiring a Floor Manager for our Hyderabad team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout Reliance Digital Global Group:\nReliance Digital Global Group is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Train and motivate the sales team to deliver excellent service\n• Monitor inventory levels and coordinate replenishment activities\n• Handle customer queries, complaints, and escalations effectively\n• Maintain high standards of store hygiene and cleanliness\n• Ensure visual merchandising standards are maintained at all times\n• Prepare daily sales reports and share insights with management\n• Achieve sales targets and improve store performance metrics\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• CA / CMA / CFA certification\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in CRM\n• Proficiency in Loss Prevention\n• Proficiency in KPI Management\n• Proficiency in Retail Operations\n• Proficiency in SAP Retail\n• Proficiency in Retail Analytics\n• Proficiency in Team Leadership\n• Proficiency in E-commerce Integration\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Learning & development budget\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Hyderabad, Telangana, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Reliance Digital Global Group!",
